1
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:06,700
Why is everybody using these tiny,little lights nowadays?
請問現在為何都用小燈泡？ 

2
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:08,990
I remember when people used big ones.
我記得以前都用大燈泡

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,700
That's a good story,Grandpa.
錢德爺爺話當年

4
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:19,540
Wow. Monica's letting other people help decorate her tree?
摩妮卡讓別人佈置她的聖誕樹

6
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:22,040
Did someone get her drunk again,or...?
誰又把她灌醉了嗎？

7
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:26,810
Having a perfect tree is not what Christmas is about.
聖誕節的意義不在於聖誕樹 

8
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,950
It's about being with loved ones.
而在於與所愛的人共度

9
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:31,680
That is nice. And we're done. Ta-da!
真好，佈置好了

10
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:36,990
It just doesn't quite feel like Christmas to me.
我總覺得它少了一股聖誕味

11
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,560
Oh,here.
那這樣呢

12
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,630
See,now it feels like Christmas.
這樣才像聖誕節

13
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,600
The One With The Routine
本集播出：「舞林高手」

00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,600
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

14
00:01:24,050 --> 00:01:26,540
And that's the story of the dreidel.
這就是猶太陀螺的由來

15
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:32,550
Some people trace the Christmas tree to the Egyptians...
有些人說聖誕樹源自古埃及

16
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:37,450
who'd bring palm branches into huts on the shortest day of the year...
在每年白畫最短的日子 他們會把棕櫚枝帶進屋裡

17
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:40,250
symbolizing life's triumph over death.
象徵生命戰勝死亡

18
00:01:40,530 --> 00:01:43,430
And that was,like,4000 years ago.
那是4千年前的事了

19
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:47,360
Around the same time that you started this story.
你開始講古也差不多是那時候

20
00:01:50,770 --> 00:01:52,900
-Hey,you guys. -Hey. What's up?
你們好 喬伊

21
00:01:53,140 --> 00:01:57,410
I had to get out of the apartment. Janine's stretching all over.
我不出門不行 吉寧到處拉筋

24
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:59,700
Everywhere I look she's like....
一轉頭就看到她在…

25
00:02:03,990 --> 00:02:06,550
I can see why that's hard to resist.
難怪你無法抗拒

26
00:02:07,090 --> 00:02:09,060
I like her so much.
我好喜歡她

27
00:02:09,290 --> 00:02:11,090
I'm sorry she doesn't feel the same.
可惜她對你沒感覺 

28
00:02:11,330 --> 00:02:13,060
I know. And she's so sweet.
就是啊，她好可愛

29
00:02:13,290 --> 00:02:16,960
I just want to feed her grapes and brush her hair.
我好想餵她吃葡萄 幫她梳頭

30
00:02:17,970 --> 00:02:20,630
You are aware that she's not a monkey,right?
你知道她不是猴子吧？

31
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:26,230
I am so over Janine.
我已經不在乎吉寧了

32
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:31,940
Yeah,at first I thought she was hot, but now she's like old news.
我原本覺得她很火辣 現在她已經成了過去式

33
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,910
-Hey,guys. -Janine!
你們好 吉寧

34
00:02:37,490 --> 00:02:40,580
I'm gonna be a dancer on a TV special for New Year's Eve.
我剛接到除夕特別節目的通告

35
00:02:40,790 --> 00:02:44,750
It's called some sort of Dickin' Rockin' Dicky Eve.
叫什麼狄克搖滾狄奇之夜的

36
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:49,090
Hold it.
慢著

37
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:53,090
Are you talking about Dick Clark's New Year's Rockin' Eve?
是狄剋剋拉克新年搖滾之夜嗎 

38
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:55,170
Yeah,that's what I said.
就是那個

39
00:02:57,710 --> 00:03:00,540
Oh,my God, we love that show!
天哪，我們愛死那個節目了

40
00:03:00,810 --> 00:03:03,800
Ross and I have been watching it since I can remember.
從我有記憶以來 羅斯和我每年都看

41
00:03:04,050 --> 00:03:07,450
You're still just a little fat girl inside, aren't you?
內心深處的你仍是個小胖妹

42
00:03:09,550 --> 00:03:12,180
I'm gonna be one of the party people.
我今年要去當狂歡派對來賓

43
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:17,220
You're gonna be a party person? Those guys rock the most!
你要當去派對來賓？ 那些人最酷了

44
00:03:17,690 --> 00:03:21,060
They said to bring someone. Want to be my dance partner?
他們叫我帶人去 你願意當我的舞伴嗎？

45
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:23,990
I would love to spend New Year's with you.
當然，我很願意跟你跨年

46
00:03:24,230 --> 00:03:27,030
They're taping tomorrow. I don't understand why..
明天就要錄影了，我也不太懂

47
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:28,700
Well,how it works is...
是這樣的 

48
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:32,700
the part with Dick Clark in Times Square is actually live.
時代廣場的部分是現場直播

49
00:03:32,970 --> 00:03:36,000
But they tape some of the party stuff ahead of time.
但他們會預錄狂歡派對的畫面 

50
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:38,580
Not a lot of people know that.
知道的人並不多

51
00:03:40,050 --> 00:03:41,710
Do you guys want to come too?
你們也想去嗎？

52
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:45,580
-Are you serious? -We are there!
真的還假的？ 一言為定

53
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,750
What are you laughing at?
你笑什麼笑？

54
00:03:51,060 --> 00:03:54,930
Well,I used to date him, but you're still going out with her.
我跟他交往過 但你還跟她在一起

55
00:03:57,870 --> 00:04:00,430
Thanks. Great,so we can all go together.
謝謝…那我們就一起去

56
00:04:00,670 --> 00:04:02,600
I gotta run. I'll catch you later.
我得走了，回頭見

57
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,200
Bye,Janine.
再見 吉寧再見

58
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:09,200
Did she just ask me out on a date?
她是不是約我了？

59
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:12,070
I don't think so.
應該不是

60
00:04:12,350 --> 00:04:15,710
She invited him to the biggest party of the millennium.
她找他參加 千禧年最盛大的晚會耶

61
00:04:15,950 --> 00:04:18,510
Yeah,but she also invited you and Ross.
但她也找了你和羅斯

62
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:21,920
I'm sorry,I don't think that that was a romantic thing.
很抱歉，那應該不算約會

63
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:25,060
Well, maybe. But,hey, I know how I can find out.
或許吧，但我有一個辦法

64
00:04:25,290 --> 00:04:27,020
It's a New Year's Eve party.
我們不是要參加跨年晚會？

65
00:04:27,260 --> 00:04:31,700
So at midnight,I can kiss her. And if she kisses me back, great.
到了午夜，我可以親她 要是她也回吻，漂亮

67
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:34,730
If she says, "What are you doing?"
要是她說「你幹什麼？」

68
00:04:34,970 --> 00:04:37,730
I can say, "lt wasn't me, it was New Year's."
我就說「都是新年害的」

69
00:04:39,770 --> 00:04:42,470
That's better than Ross kissing me in high school...
比高中時羅斯想親我要好 

70
00:04:42,710 --> 00:04:46,270
and saying that he did it because he needed Chap Stick.
他說他需要護唇膏

71
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:50,450
It was a dry day.
那天很乾燥

72
00:04:53,820 --> 00:04:58,220
We are going to Dick Clark's New Year's Rockin' Eve!
我們要上狄剋剋拉克跨年晚會 

73
00:04:58,430 --> 00:05:00,290
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

74
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:02,550
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

75
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:04,760
Oh,my God!
我的天啊

76
00:05:12,110 --> 00:05:14,130
Okay,I've been on sets before...
聽著，我錄過影

77
00:05:14,410 --> 00:05:16,100
so let me give you some advice.
我有些建議

78
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:19,680
It's a show,but we're just dancing. It's no big deal.
雖然是上電視，我們只管跳舞 沒什麼大不了的 

79
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:22,970
Important thing to remember: Stay cool.
最重要的是要酷

80
00:05:23,250 --> 00:05:24,840
-Got it. -Okay.
瞭解

81
00:05:25,450 --> 00:05:28,180
Oh,my God! It's just like I dreamed it!
天哪，跟我夢想的一樣

82
00:05:29,520 --> 00:05:30,820
Everyone! Gather up!
全體集合

83
00:05:31,690 --> 00:05:33,820
-Excuse us! -Excuse us!
借過

84
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:37,620
The music's gonna start, you're gonna dance...
我們的做法是 音樂一放，你們就跳舞 

86
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:40,960
we'll tape it. Don't look at the camera. Questions?
我們會錄影，你們不要看鏡頭 有問題嗎？

87
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:44,870
Yeah,I have a question. When is this gonna air?
我有，什麼時候播出？

89
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:48,870
Yeah. Now,you guys dance over there...
好，你們去那邊跳 

90
00:05:49,180 --> 00:05:51,840
you guys,over there. I want you two here.
你們去那邊跳 你們兩個在這裡

91
00:05:52,050 --> 00:05:53,310
Everyone else,spread out.
其他人散開

92
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:56,420
We'd rather not dance together because we're brother and sister.
我們最好不要配一對 因為我們是兄妹

93
00:05:56,580 --> 00:05:58,250
Yeah,it would seem kind of weird.
對，那樣會有點怪

94
00:05:58,420 --> 00:06:03,580
As weird as coming all the way down here and then having to go home right now?
會比大老遠跑來 卻得立刻滾回家來得怪嗎？

96
00:06:05,890 --> 00:06:07,760
So when is it gonna air?
所以是什麼時候播？

97
00:06:13,130 --> 00:06:15,430
You look in the kitchen, I got the closet.
你找廚房，我找後面的櫃子

98
00:06:15,700 --> 00:06:18,970
I can save you time,ladies. I'm right here.
不必浪費時間了，我在這裡

99
00:06:19,670 --> 00:06:23,800
Yeah. Why don't you take a walk? This doesn't concern you.
錢德，你出去一下 這件事與你無關

100
00:06:24,910 --> 00:06:27,310
We're looking for our presents from Monica.
我們在找摩妮卡送的聖誕禮物

101
00:06:27,550 --> 00:06:28,810
That's terrible.
什麼？太差勁了 

102
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,680
No, we do it every year.
不會，我們每年都找

103
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:33,390
Oh, well, that makes it not terrible.
那就不差勁了

104
00:06:34,890 --> 00:06:36,410
Yeah,we never find them.
但我們沒有找到過 

105
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:40,530
She's always bested us, that wily...minx.
她老是打敗我們，奸詐的查某

106
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,350
We'll search here for an hour...
放心，我們找個1小時 

107
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:46,260
and then we'll go to Joey's and search,okay?
就會換到喬伊那邊找，好嗎？

108
00:06:46,530 --> 00:06:49,870
-You can't look for Monica's presents. -We have to.
不好，你們不能找她送的禮物 我們一定要找

109
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:54,240
You don't have to. And you can't, because I live here too.
你們不一定要找，也不能找 因為我也住在這裡

111
00:06:55,340 --> 00:06:58,040
Well,then you should look with us.
那你應該跟我們一起找

112
00:06:58,780 --> 00:06:59,770
Why?
為什麼？

113
00:06:59,950 --> 00:07:02,580
Aren't you worried about what to get Monica?
你都不愁要送摩妮卡什麼嗎？ 

114
00:07:02,850 --> 00:07:05,050
No,I have a great idea for her present.
不會，我有個很棒的構想

115
00:07:05,290 --> 00:07:08,260
Oh,that's it? A great idea? Oh,yeah?
就只有很棒的構想？

116
00:07:09,420 --> 00:07:12,050
What if she gets you a great present...
那樣是不夠的 要是她送你一個大禮

118
00:07:12,290 --> 00:07:14,420
two mediums and lots of little ones...
兩個普通禮和一堆小禮呢？

119
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:17,790
and you just get her one present? She'll feel bad.
而你只送她一個大禮 她一定會很難過

120
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:20,590
Why would you do that to her? Why? Why?
你為什麼要讓她難過？ 為什麼…

121
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,730
-If I help,we can find them faster! -Right!
有我幫忙找得更快 沒錯

122
00:07:27,410 --> 00:07:28,430
We have a live one!
逮到一個了 

123
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:31,310
-Oh,it's a Macy's bag! -Yeah.
是梅西百貨的袋子

124
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:34,870
Who's it for?
這是給誰的？

125
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:40,750
"Dear losers, do you really think I'd hide presents under the couch?
親愛的俗辣 你們真以為我會藏在沙發下？

126
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:44,790
P.S. Chandler, I knew they'd break you."
又：錢德，我就知道你會讓步

127
00:07:48,130 --> 00:07:50,720
Uh-oh. She may be onto us.
她可能已經發現了

128
00:07:51,570 --> 00:07:54,630
We are so gonna find them this year.
我們今年一定要找到

129
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:58,640
You said you'd go across the hall and look. Do you do that every year?
你們剛才說會到對面去找 該不會是每年都去吧？

130
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,930
Yeah.
是啊

131
00:08:00,170 --> 00:08:02,840
You don't go into the back of my closet...
你們沒有到我的櫃子裡面 

132
00:08:03,110 --> 00:08:05,480
and look under my gym bag or anything?
翻我的健身袋底下吧？

133
00:08:07,110 --> 00:08:08,670
-No. Never do that. -No.
沒有，從來沒有

134
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:14,950
That's where Joey gave me stuff to store that I've never seen.
喬伊會托我保管東西 我看都沒看過

135
00:08:17,660 --> 00:08:19,750
Okay, that did not just happen.
剛才的事是幻覺

136
00:08:27,940 --> 00:08:28,920
Here comes a camera.
又有攝影機來了

137
00:08:29,170 --> 00:08:32,200
Right. No biggie. Stay loose.
好，小意思，放輕鬆

138
00:08:41,850 --> 00:08:43,940
Why do they keep doing that?
他們為什麼一直避開？

139
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:47,020
We have to get up on one of those platforms.
想上鏡頭就得上那些平台

140
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:48,950
They've been taping them all day.
他們一直拍平台上的人 

141
00:08:49,220 --> 00:08:50,350
Right.
沒錯

142
00:08:55,230 --> 00:08:57,560
What'd you guys do to get up on there?
你們為什麼能上去？

143
00:08:57,830 --> 00:08:59,360
We learned how to dance.
我們有練過

144
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:04,400
When you learned to dance, did you forget how to put on underpants?
你練舞時也忘了穿內褲嗎？

145
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:06,270
Yeah!

146
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:12,810
-Hey,you're a good dancer. -Really?
你跳得很好嘛 是嗎？

147
00:09:13,050 --> 00:09:15,210
You'd be better if you loosened your hips.
臀部再放鬆一點會更好

148
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:18,150
-What do you mean? -Like this.
怎麼說？ 像這樣

149
00:09:19,990 --> 00:09:23,680
That's it. Feel the rhythm. That's better.
就是這樣，跟著節奏擺動 好多了

150
00:09:26,690 --> 00:09:28,090
You're dancing with her.
你去跟那個女生跳

151
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,860
-We're together. -Yeah,we came together.
不，我們是一起來的

152
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:33,100
I don't see it.
我看不出來

153
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:37,490
You are dancing with the tall guy. Tall guy,raise your hand!
你去跟那個高個子跳 高個子，舉手

154
00:09:38,610 --> 00:09:43,240
Hey,buddy. Let me dance with her. I like her, and I think I have a shot.
不…老兄，拜託讓我跟她跳 我很喜歡她，我覺得我有機會

155
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:45,600
Really,you think so? I don't.
你覺得有？我覺得沒有

156
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:03,390
I couldn't find anything.. Hey,wait!
喬伊那裡什麼都沒… 等等！

157
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,720
Yeah,we found them.
我們找到了 

158
00:10:04,970 --> 00:10:06,990
They were in the guest-room closet.
在客房衣櫥的外套後面

159
00:10:07,300 --> 00:10:10,330
You have nothing to worry about because they're crap.
你不必擔心了，都是些爛東西

160
00:10:13,170 --> 00:10:15,230
Those are mine. I got those for you.
那是我要送給你們的禮物

161
00:10:18,410 --> 00:10:20,900
Oh. Thanks,Chandler,they're great!
謝了，好棒喔

162
00:10:23,150 --> 00:10:26,350
Chandler,what is this very weird metal A-Z thing?
這個奇怪的金屬AZ是什麼

163
00:10:26,650 --> 00:10:29,820
Those are bookends. That's a great gift.
那是書擋，是很棒的禮物

164
00:10:30,090 --> 00:10:33,250
Oh. Okay,I'm sorry. Thank you for my "az."
好，抱歉，謝謝你送的AZ （AZ音近屁股ass）

165
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,930
Make sure you put all that stuff back in the closet.
記得放回衣櫃裡，好嗎？

166
00:10:39,170 --> 00:10:40,430
Yes,okay.
好…

167
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:45,160
By the way,I think it's really nice of you that even after you moved...
對了，你人真好 都搬家了...

168
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:48,200
you still keep storing that stuff for Joey.
還幫喬伊保管東西

169
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:05,790
Hey,dancing girl?
喂，舞女

170
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:09,330
Can I go to the bathroom?
我想上廁所

171
00:11:11,570 --> 00:11:13,500
Here we go. Yeah.
來轉一下 好了

173
00:11:18,810 --> 00:11:20,210
Looking good,Gellers!
很不錯喔，蓋勒兄妹

174
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,870
We know!
還用你說

175
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:28,210
That snippy guy's the one who decides who gets on the platform.
你看那個拽人 他專門指定上平台的人

176
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,180
-We should go dance by him. -Okay.
我們應該去他面前跳 好

177
00:11:38,390 --> 00:11:40,190
Okay,everybody,hold!
全部暫停

178
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:44,760
Next on the platforms are....
接下來的平台舞者有…

179
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:51,530
You two! And....
你們兩個，還有…

180
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,430
-You two! -Cool!
你們兩個

181
00:11:55,710 --> 00:11:56,840
Excuse me,sir?
請問一下

182
00:11:57,010 --> 00:11:59,240
Would it help if I weren't wearing underpants?
如果我不穿內褲會入選嗎？ 

183
00:11:59,410 --> 00:12:00,940
Monica!
摩妮卡

184
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,210
Would it?
會嗎？

185
00:12:05,050 --> 00:12:06,310
How about me?
那我不穿呢？

186
00:12:13,890 --> 00:12:16,560
Hey,tall guy!
高個子

187
00:12:17,870 --> 00:12:20,930
I want to talk to you about that girl you're dancing with.
我想跟你聊聊你的舞伴

188
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:24,900
She's nice, huh? To think I almost brought my wife to this.
她真不賴，我還差點帶老婆來

189
00:12:25,610 --> 00:12:28,600
Yeah. Yeah. Okay.
是啊…好

190
00:12:31,450 --> 00:12:33,740
Look,I came with that girl,okay?
老兄，我和她是一起來的 

191
00:12:33,950 --> 00:12:36,610
I plan to kiss her at the New Year's countdown.
我想在倒數時吻她

192
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:38,580
I'm trying to win her over. I..
我想追她 所以能不能… 

193
00:12:38,850 --> 00:12:40,340
I don't think so.
不行

194
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:42,420
You can dance with my partner.
拜託啦，你可以跟我的舞伴跳 

195
00:12:42,690 --> 00:12:44,720
She's real mellow.
她跳得強強滾

196
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:49,550
Look,you dating this girl you came with?
你在跟這個女生交往嗎？

197
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:52,270
I was hoping after tonight that maybe I could....
我希望過了今晚可以…

198
00:12:52,570 --> 00:12:55,800
No. No. She's fair game if you ask me. Sorry,buddy.
那就是公平競爭，抱歉

199
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,430
All right. Hey.
好吧

200
00:12:57,910 --> 00:13:02,070
Fair is fair. When you're right, you're right. What can I say?
公平競爭 你說得對，我還能說什麼

201
00:13:06,610 --> 00:13:07,980
Are you in second grade?
你是小學生嗎？

202
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:10,980
Hey, man, you're the one who wet his pants.
尿褲子的是你

203
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:19,820
Monica would not hide the presents down here.
摩妮卡不會把禮物藏在這裡的

204
00:13:19,990 --> 00:13:24,260
No,but she did. Look,there's that old hippie I've always wanted.
怎麼不會 我一直想要一個老嬉皮

205
00:13:25,530 --> 00:13:28,970
If they are here, Gunther knows about it.
要是藏在這裡，阿甘一定知道

206
00:13:29,140 --> 00:13:33,800
And I could get it out of him. He's had a huge crush on me.
我可以去套他，他很喜歡我

207
00:13:33,970 --> 00:13:37,270
That's not fair to play with his head, though. You do it.
這樣利用他不公平，還是你去 

208
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:39,110
Okay.
好

209
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:42,580
Hey,Gunther.
阿甘

210
00:13:43,850 --> 00:13:45,010
Hi.

211
00:13:45,190 --> 00:13:49,090
Getting to be that holiday time again,huh?
聖誕佳節又要來了

212
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:52,160
Yes,it's like a miracle.
聖誕節確實很神奇

213
00:13:52,330 --> 00:13:57,420
I was thinking,since it's the time of giving gifts...
我想說既然到了送禮的季節

214
00:13:57,600 --> 00:14:01,030
I was wondering,are there any presents around here for me?
不知道這裡有沒有我的禮物？ 

215
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:04,140
You know what I mean?
你懂我的意思吧

216
00:14:04,970 --> 00:14:08,570
-I think I found them. -That's the Toys for Tots collection bin.
我找到了 那是要捐出去的玩具

217
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:13,680
-That's awfully convenient,don't you think? -For the tots it is.
很方便不是嗎？ 對捐贈單位來說

218
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:17,350
-Hey,you guys,guess what. -Did you find them?
你們猜怎樣？ 你找到了嗎？

219
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:20,610
No,Gunther fainted.
不是，阿甘昏倒了

220
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:27,020
Man,this sucks.
真討厭

221
00:14:27,330 --> 00:14:30,560
If Mom and Dad don't see us on TV after we made them jealous...
要是跟爸媽愛現完卻沒上電視 

222
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:32,990
then who's gonna be the losers then?
到時候是誰遜？

223
00:14:34,740 --> 00:14:37,530
I know what'll get us up on a platform.
我知道怎樣可以上平台了 

224
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:39,240
What?
怎樣？

225
00:14:39,410 --> 00:14:40,870
The routine!
跳招牌舞

226
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:45,340
We haven't done the routine since middle school.
我們中學畢業後就沒跳過了

227
00:14:45,550 --> 00:14:47,910
When the snippy guy sees the routine...
等那個拽人看過招牌舞 

228
00:14:48,180 --> 00:14:50,620
he'll want to build us our own platform.
搭都會幫我們搭一座平台

229
00:14:50,890 --> 00:14:52,110
Was it that good?
有那麼贊嗎？

230
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:56,450
We got honorable mention in the brother/sister dance category!
我們得了兄弟姐妹組的特別獎

231
00:14:56,760 --> 00:15:00,220
It's almost fake midnight. Do we really have any other choice?
假午夜快到了，我們還能怎樣

232
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:03,630
Okay,let's do it.
那好吧

233
00:15:04,130 --> 00:15:07,190
Mom and Dad are gonna be so faced!
爸媽會嫉妒死

234
00:15:13,710 --> 00:15:15,770
Five,six,seven,eight!
五六七八

235
00:15:57,620 --> 00:16:02,150
So do we really need to ask who's going up on the platform next?
接下來該誰上平台還用問嗎？

236
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:05,360
You get up there and do that again, exactly like that.
不用，你們上去照樣再跳一遍

237
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:12,260
Get this. Dick will want it for the Bloopers show.
拍下來當漏網鏡頭用

238
00:16:13,300 --> 00:16:16,000
All right,cut! Listen up,everyone!
卡 全體注意

239
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:18,360
When we start again, it'll be the countdown...
接下來是倒數計時 

240
00:16:18,670 --> 00:16:21,640
so I want to see everybody's excitement!
大家要high

241
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:23,200
Hey,guy!

242
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:25,470
You got three seconds to get away.
限你3秒鐘之內離開我的舞伴

243
00:16:25,710 --> 00:16:27,040
What's going on here?
怎麼了？ 

244
00:16:27,350 --> 00:16:29,480
Take a look at the guy's pants!
你看他的褲子

245
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:34,210
You told us to show excitement, but don't you think he went overboard?
你是叫我們要high 但他也high過頭了吧？

246
00:16:35,860 --> 00:16:37,480
What's the matter with you? Go!
你變態啊？給我出場 

247
00:16:37,690 --> 00:16:39,720
Yeah,take a hike,wet pants!
滾啦，失禁男

248
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:43,660
Can you believe this?
你相信嗎？

249
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:46,060
We're on the platform for the millennial moment!
進入千禧年時我們會在平台上 

250
00:16:46,300 --> 00:16:47,460
I know!
就是啊

251
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:50,730
You haven't been practicing the routine, have you?
你沒有偷練招牌舞吧？ 

252
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:52,700
No.
當然沒有

253
00:16:53,970 --> 00:16:55,460
Me too!
我也有

254
00:16:56,340 --> 00:16:57,740
When the music starts...
回到現場時...

255
00:16:58,010 --> 00:17:01,040
I was thinking about maybe going into the robot.
我想跳機器人舞步

256
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:07,980
Ross, we should stick to the routine. We don't want to look stupid.
羅斯 跳招牌舞就好，免得丟臉

257
00:17:10,090 --> 00:17:12,680
All right, we're back! Ten seconds left.
回到現場，倒數10秒 
258
00:17:12,930 --> 00:17:16,050
-Ten. -Nine,eight.
10，9，8，

259
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:19,660
-Seven. -Okay,it all comes down to this.
7… 好，這一刻終於來了 

260
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:22,930
Whatever happens,happens.
一切順其自然

261
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,230
Destiny.
聽天由命

262
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:28,500
three,two,one!
3，2，1

263
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:30,510
-Cut! -No!
卡 不！

264
00:17:32,750 --> 00:17:34,440
Year!
快樂

265
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:37,340
Happy "No" Year!
新年不快樂

266
00:17:38,890 --> 00:17:42,580
Now we go to the live shot of Times Square. That's a wrap!
接著是時代廣場的現場畫面 大家辛苦了，收工

267
00:17:48,930 --> 00:17:50,860
What did that snippy guy say?
那個拽人說什麼？

268
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:54,330
I think he's kicking out anyone who's not dancing.
他把不跳舞的人趕走了 

269
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:56,660
So just keep dancing.
所以繼續跳

270
00:18:09,220 --> 00:18:10,410
Hey,look who I found.
看我找到什麼 

271
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,050
Oh,hi,guys!
你們好

272
00:18:12,790 --> 00:18:15,190
Birds have a very good sense of direction.
鳥類的方向感很好 

273
00:18:15,420 --> 00:18:18,290
I thought maybe they could help us find the presents.
或許它們可以幫忙找出禮物

274
00:18:19,390 --> 00:18:22,890
Yes,if the presents are hidden south for the winter.
如果禮物藏在南方過冬的話

275
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:27,560
Or we could just follow your clever jokes. Any ideas? Didn't think so.
順著你的笑話去找也行 你知道在哪裡嗎？當然不知道

276
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:31,800
Come on,show us where the presents are.
來，把禮物找出來

277
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:35,040
The duck seems to think that Monica got me garbage.
鴨子似乎認為摩妮卡送我垃圾

278
00:18:35,280 --> 00:18:38,940
I wonder what I could get Monica that's as good as garbage.
什麼樣的回禮能跟垃圾一樣好

279
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,540
How about my "az"?
我的AZ如何？

280
00:18:46,250 --> 00:18:50,020
-Hey. This is hollow. -What?
這是空的 什麼？ 

282
00:18:50,190 --> 00:18:53,960
This bench,it's hollow. I can't believe I never knew that!
這排座椅是空心的 我居然都不知道

284
00:18:55,660 --> 00:18:58,890
-Oh,the presents! -Don't look directly at them!
我們的禮物 不！不要直視它們

285
00:19:00,900 --> 00:19:01,930
What?
什麼？

286
00:19:02,170 --> 00:19:04,600
All right,no,we could look at them.
沒事，可以看

287
00:19:04,810 --> 00:19:06,270
This one's for me!
這是我的

288
00:19:06,470 --> 00:19:08,770
This one's for Chandler. Here.
這是錢德的，拿去 

289
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:12,500
-And the big one's for me! -Oh,let's open them!
大包的是我的 趕快拆來看

291
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:16,910
-Wait a minute. We can't do this. -Why?
等等，我們不能這樣 為什麼？ 

292
00:19:17,180 --> 00:19:20,480
I don't want to know what Monica got me.
我不想知道摩妮卡送我什麼

293
00:19:20,690 --> 00:19:24,420
I'm sure she worked hard at getting it and wanting to surprise me.
她一定很用心的替我找禮物 想給我驚喜

294
00:19:24,660 --> 00:19:26,650
And you guys are gonna ruin that.
你們這樣會壞事

295
00:19:26,930 --> 00:19:30,190
We have to put these back. This is not what Christmas is about.
我們得把禮物放回去 這樣不叫聖誕節

296
00:19:31,670 --> 00:19:33,660
Whatever,Linus. I'm opening mine.
誰理你，我要拆我的

297
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:39,830
Nobody is opening anything, okay?
誰也不准拆

298
00:19:40,140 --> 00:19:43,840
I want to see the look on her face when I give her my present.
我不知道你們怎麼想 但我想看摩妮卡收到我禮物的表情

300
00:19:44,110 --> 00:19:47,600
I'm sure she wants to see the look on my face when I get mine.
她一定也想看 我收到禮物的表情

301
00:19:47,850 --> 00:19:51,650
So,please,please,can we just...? Can we put them back?
所以求求你們放回去

302
00:19:52,690 --> 00:19:55,050
-Will you get us better gifts? -Fine.
你會送我們更好的禮物嗎？ 好啦

303
00:19:57,460 --> 00:19:58,820
Hey,guys.
我回來了

304
00:20:00,990 --> 00:20:02,520
You found the presents?
你們找到禮物了？ 

305
00:20:03,030 --> 00:20:04,960
You let them find the presents?
錢德，你讓她們找到？

306
00:20:05,230 --> 00:20:06,260
Great.
帥啊

307
00:20:06,430 --> 00:20:10,300
Do you know how long it took me to find you that water purifier?
你知道那個濾水器多難找嗎？

308
00:20:11,210 --> 00:20:14,870
-That's what you got me? -Yes,I see. That look is priceless.
你送我濾水器？ 這下我懂了，你的表情真棒

309
00:20:21,420 --> 00:20:23,650
Home sweet home,huh?
甜蜜的家

310
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:27,510
Nice to get back to reality.
回到現實真好

311
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:32,820
Plus,we know how the New Year's gonna go off.
我們也知道新年會怎樣了

312
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:36,660
I guess there's no reason for all that Y2K panic,you know?
千禧蟲根本沒什麼，對吧？

313
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,330
Anyway,good night.
好吧，晚安

314
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,860
-Joey? -Yeah?
喬伊 怎樣？

315
00:20:45,410 --> 00:20:46,770
Three...
3...

316
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:49,330
two,one.
2，1

317
00:20:56,780 --> 00:20:58,220
Happy New Year.
新年快樂

318
00:21:03,060 --> 00:21:04,610
What was that for?
這是幹什麼？

319
00:21:05,090 --> 00:21:08,260
Tonight when they yelled "cut" and we didn't get to kiss...
今晚當他們喊卡 我們沒能接吻

320
00:21:08,460 --> 00:21:12,420
I was really,really disappointed, and I just....
我真的很失望 我真的…

322
00:21:12,930 --> 00:21:14,920
I just really wanted to kiss you.
真的很想親你 

323
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:16,800
Really?
真的？

324
00:21:18,270 --> 00:21:22,270
In the moment,I really wanted to kiss you too. In the moment.
那時候我也很想親你… 那時候

325
00:21:22,810 --> 00:21:25,210
-In the moment. -But only in the moment.
那時候 只有那時候

326
00:21:27,310 --> 00:21:31,440
So do you want to kiss again?
你…想再親一次嗎？

327
00:21:32,290 --> 00:21:35,380
Sure. New Year's Eve is only two weeks away.
想啊，離除夕只有2個星期

328
00:21:35,790 --> 00:21:36,810
Can you wait?
你能等嗎？ 

329
00:21:37,290 --> 00:21:38,720
No.
不能

330
00:21:40,590 --> 00:21:41,790
Me neither.
我也是

331
00:21:44,930 --> 00:21:47,760
Three,two....
3，2…

332
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:50,300
You don't have to count down every time we kiss.
不必每次接吻都倒數 

333
00:21:50,570 --> 00:21:52,470
Oh. Okay.
好

334
00:21:53,510 --> 00:21:58,500
Except I sort of felt like I needed a couple seconds to get ready.
但我覺得我需要幾秒鐘做準備

335
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:24,690
We were on the platform,ready to dance into the new millennium...
我們在平台上 準備帶全世界跳進千禧年

336
00:22:24,910 --> 00:22:27,640
and the guy yells,"Cut!"
那傢伙卻喊了卡

337
00:22:27,940 --> 00:22:33,540
-So Joey didn't get to kiss Janine? -Nope,he sure didn't.
所以喬伊也沒親到吉寧？ 當然沒有

338
00:22:33,710 --> 00:22:37,240
I guess that means that you guys are still tied.
所以你和喬伊還是平分秋色羅

339
00:22:37,420 --> 00:22:41,480
I don't know about that. I think she saw us do our routine.
那可不見得 她應該看到我們的招牌舞了

340
00:22:41,660 --> 00:22:45,320
I may have boogied right into first place.
我用布吉舞步打頭陣

341
00:22:45,890 --> 00:22:49,790
So you guys are telling me that you actually did...
等等，你們真的跳了 

342
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:52,560
the routine from eighth grade?
八年級的招牌舞？

343
00:22:52,730 --> 00:22:56,330
Yeah! But of course we had to update it a little bit.
對，不過當然得稍做修正

344
00:22:56,570 --> 00:22:59,510
Hey, by the way, quick thinking about catching me.
你反應真快，知道要接住我

345
00:23:00,770 --> 00:23:03,400
There's no way you could've done the end...
我正想說 你們絕不可能...

346
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:06,010
the way you guys did it back then.
照以前的結尾跳

347
00:23:06,980 --> 00:23:10,470
What? We could do it.
什麼？當然可以

348
00:23:10,750 --> 00:23:15,690
I don't know. You were a lot bigger.. I mean,stronger back then.
不行吧，你以前胖…壯多了

349
00:23:17,620 --> 00:23:19,290
I can do it,okay?
我可以，好嗎？

350
00:23:19,690 --> 00:23:22,030
Come on,let's go! Come on.
來吧

351
00:23:23,300 --> 00:23:24,990
One,two,three,four...
一二三四

352
00:23:25,730 --> 00:23:27,790
five,six,seven,eight.
五六七八

353
00:23:28,030 --> 00:23:29,520
I can't do it!
我不行

354
00:23:31,870 --> 00:23:35,000
Now,you do that,you're on TV.
那樣跳就能上電視了

355
